## Technical Requirements

- Use existing libraries when available—don't build from scratch.
- All user-facing text must support localization (l10n).
- Don't manually edit `Info.plist` or entitlements—make changes only in `Project.swift` (handled by Tuist).
- Don't add files from `Common` manually—they're already included by `Project.swift`.
- Use logging instead of `print` for output.

## DevOps-Friendly Flow (Must Follow)

- No manual setup in Xcode's GUI.
- All settings must be defined in files (`Project.swift`, `.xcconfig`, `.plist`, etc.).
- Builds must be reproducible using `tuist generate` and `xcodebuild`.
- Keep versioning defined in files. This repository does not sign or provision — that happens outside it.
- Use only CLI tools that work with CI/CD.